           "shortComment": "Kmet failed to catch his only target in Sunday's 9-3 loss to the Vikings.",
           "longComment": "While Kmet played 51 of 74 offensive snaps in Week 2, he ran just 13 pass routes and was asked to block 37 times. Kmet plays a bunch in a Chicago offense that likes to use multiple tight ends, but his route participation isn't strong enough to warrant serious fantasy consideration if Colston Loveland is healthy."
