           "date": "2026-09-21T23:29Z",
           "shortComment": "Locke (foot) is set to miss a few weeks, Todd Archer of ESPN.com reported Monday.",
           "longComment": "Locke exited Sunday's win over the Commanders early with a foot injury. The safety has plantar fasciitis and will need a significant amount of time to recover. With Locke out and Malik Hooker (forearm) dealing with an injury, it is unclear which defensive backs will rotate over to free safety for the Cowboys."
