           "shortComment": "Smith had zero carries during Monday's 31-10 win versus the Broncos.",
           "longComment": "Kenneth Walker saw a heavy workload in the win, while rookie Emmett Johnson recorded eight carries as his backup. Smith was a non-factor on offense, logging just three snaps on special teams. The backfield arrangement isn't expected to change while Walker and Johnson are healthy."
