           "shortComment": "Remigio returned two punts for seven yards and three kicks for 78 yards during Monday's 31-10 win versus the Broncos.",
           "longComment": "Remigio did not log any snaps on offense in Week 1, but he held his own in the return game. He figures to play a similar role come Sunday night, when Kansas City is set to host the Colts."
