           "shortComment": "Young (hamstring) is questionable to return to Sunday's game against the Chargers.",
           "longComment": "Young exited the second half of Sunday's contest due to a hamstring injury. The wide receiver is the fifth option for the Raiders offense, with sixth option Cody White recording two touchdowns Week 2. It is unclear how significant Young's injury is."
