           "shortComment": "Rodriguez recorded 14 tackles (five solo) during Sunday's 27-13 loss at Las Vegas.",
           "longComment": "The Raiders were able to run the ball 37 times in Week 1, setting Rodriguez up for a memorable first regular-season game as a pro. He already profiles as a strong IDP option in most formats as the Dolphins look to a Week 2 matchup against San Francisco."
