           "shortComment": "Edmunds compiled eight total tackles (seven solo) in Sunday night's 28-20 win over Dallas.",
           "longComment": "Edmunds inked a three-year deal with the Giants in March, and he has opened the season as one of the team's starting inside linebackers along with rookie Arvell Reese. The 28-year-old has reached at least 102 total tackles in each of his first eight NFL campaigns, and he will likely remain busy throughout the 2026 season with New York."
