           "status": "Active",
           "date": "2026-09-15T01:37Z",
           "shortComment": "Knight played three offensive snaps and three special-teams snaps in Sunday's 26-14 win over the Chargers.",
           "longComment": "Despite a solid preseason, Knight did not see much action in Sunday's regular-season opener. The running back was simply an emergency option behind first-round rookie Jeremiyah Love and Tyler Allgeier. Knight will likely remain in a similar role during a Week 2 home matchup against the Seahawks."
