           "shortComment": "Fautanu (ankle) is active for Sunday's game against the Patriots.",
           "longComment": "Fautanu drew the questionable tag for Week 2 after posting a DNP/LP/FP practice log. The third-year pro was cleared to play after going through pregame warmups and will once again start at left tackle."
